<p>Midpoint value is equal to the target<br>
Now is when things get interesting. When the midpoint value is equal to the=
 target, there are two possibilities:</p>
<ol>
<li>This is the lower bound of the target value.</li>
<li>This is not the lower bound, so the lower bound is somewhere further to=
