left pointer keeps getting set to <code>mid</code> when they=E2=80=99re bot=
h at the same index. Why
does this happen? </p>
<hr>
<p>Debugging the infinite loop<br>
When the left and right pointers are directly next to each other, <code>mid=
</code> ends up being positioned where the left pointer is:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: left;"=
